    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are we waiting for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A phone call. Might be a novel thing for someone as old as you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much longer must we wait here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No more questions, just wait and see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I take the call? Someone explained how it works to me a while back...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nuh-uh-uh. No can do. They'll think we're a scam call the moment they hear your robotic voice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. As you mentioned earlier, us working together is an imitation of the greatest alliance in history.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sooo... can I ask what's in store for me, if I help you find your gem?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh wait, I did get something already. I got a golden slipper thrown in my face after you scared me last night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you have any suggestions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014No, no, I wouldn't dare ask for more. Letting me live is already more than enough. You're one of Sargon's forefathers, I should be escorting you on your quest. So please, don't be hasty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though, the artifact that won first place at the Harvest Gathering seemed to resemble this very gold slipper, inlaid with sapphires...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, the two of them complete the pair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is making a ruckus in the dead of night also a way to make a fortune?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "They originally came in a pair, but one was lost forever in the depths of the river, so this other one naturally has its value halved.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please entertain my curiosity. Are all modern Nightzmora... like you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beats me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've looked into the customs and beliefs of many tribes for my plunders, fences, and abductions, but I never looked into my own birthplace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never went back after that one sunrise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't suppose... you are presently on your Khaganquest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Khaganquest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Ancient language) Khaganquest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Nuh-uh, that's the last word I ever want to hear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not doing it, not even if my ancestors compel me to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean you never performed your coming-of-age ritual?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah? It's not <i>that</i> important.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might have a few drops of Nightzmoran blood in me, but they didn't turn me into a tyrant or a conqueror, and I have no intention of letting them influence my life either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it is very important.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "How will your forebears recognize your blood, if you don't embark on your Khaganquest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine, most of them pretty much disappeared off the ends of the earth. Unlike someone I know who suddenly sprang to life at the museum just to lecture me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "So yeah, what about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard that in the Shah's time, people would shave their heads bald when they came of age, that they applied perfumed ointment to their scalps. But some say the scent smelled more like a stench... so I'm pretty curious if that's true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "I also...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$phonevibration"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, there we go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
