    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": false,
        "pfrom": "270,0",
        "pto": "270,0",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh, I didn't expect to get news so soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "switch": true,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "pfrom": "270,0",
        "pto": "270,0",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, hanim. It just so happens the gem trading post's overseer sent word that he has a gem to trade, and it fits your description in all aspects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gemstone Broker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "switch": false,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "pfrom": "270,0",
        "pto": "270,0",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, I'll go to him right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "switch": true,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "pfrom": "270,0",
        "pto": "270,0",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "But... it will be difficult negotiating a deal, even with my introduction.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gemstone Broker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "switch": false,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "pfrom": "270,0",
        "pto": "270,0",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? I heard from my subordinates they could simply sell their gems at the reception.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "switch": true,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "pfrom": "270,0",
        "pto": "270,0",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Selling is easy, but not the other way round. The trading post does not operate like a regular store. You need to offer something heavy enough to balance the scales.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gemstone Broker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "switch": false,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "pfrom": "270,0",
        "pto": "270,0",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Something heavy? In value?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I have an idea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
