        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#12$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#7$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem, yes. This is the deal I wanted to discuss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ancient mummy from the recent museum exhibition... The Nameless General of the Shah's Very Court.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The young overseer shoots her a complicated look, and leans down to the huge gilded box."
    },
    {
        "text": "Zubayr lies inside silently, with his hands folded across his chest."
    },
    {
        "text": "Narantuya thinks this is honestly Zubayr's time to shine\u2014even his dreadful golden mask seems to be emitting a soft, sacred glow."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This box looks familiar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a sarcophagus taken from the museum in its original condition... a replica of it, I mean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_chopsteeltube",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...(Lightly taps Zubayr's body)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "(Examines his chest with a flashlight)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, this isn't a regular artifact you can find anywhere. So if you could be more gentle and professional with it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I hear it came back to life, and can move on its own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "About that... I'm sure we all know the dead don't come back to life. Just Arts at play is all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, wouldn't you be afraid, if it really could move?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Afraid it might run off after, I buy it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, uh...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, is that black one your pet? Haha, what a beauty!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course the gem trading post's overseer, who controls the flow of money throughout the entire city, would have such a unique pet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Is that him, Woof?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1483_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sniffs)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woof"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sits besides the sarcophagus)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woof"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, look. It sniffed out the millennia-old stench you can never fake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's as real as my sincerity in making this deal with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, I know how precious this artifact is, and it'll be quite troublesome for you to handle it\u2014I'm basically offloading my troubles to you, so I'm not exactly hoping for a windfall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I guarantee the museum has no way of tracking me down...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, this is an extremely heavy offer you've made.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though it's still within the measuring limits of my scale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want in exchange? I hear you came for a gemstone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, that was the original plan, but I thought of something else on the way over. I don't need that gem anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm an outsider, so ingots will do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wish to be paid in Pure Gold? I'll go fetch the appropriate scales.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please bring this inside to keep others from seeing it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... we got a deal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "53_g12_gemexchange",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha, I love a man who does easy business!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like the feeling of sleeping in here one bit. You didn't have to get your subordinates to bring it here in the first place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ssh, don't speak... Just hold on a bit longer, I'll come retrieve you soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seize the chance and find the gem you're after before the day ends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, please do come back. I still need you for something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_goldbarhit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the price I'm offering. Any objection?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... \u266aRemember the crescent moon on the blade, the youth's sincerity washed into gold\u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be back for sure... no objections at all! Nope!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I'll be going now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By all means.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Blinks at Zubayr)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Blinks at Narantuya)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I look forward to any future cooperation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4140_lasher_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never said we'd have any future cooperation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lazvar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
