        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, me neither\u2014in the near future, at least.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That old thing wants me to run errands for him? Sorry, but see ya!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "53_g12_gemexchange",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...She should have understood my signal? Narantuya, if you're truly a descendant of the Nightzmora...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "A treasury awaits you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
